{
  "description": "This protocol builds a 384 well plate with from up to 14 columns from up to 2 96 well plates. It is a pythonization of this protocol, which only could not run a variable number of columns. This protocol is used for building qPCR plates.\n\n\n\n8-Channel Electronic Pipette (GEN2) P20\nOpentrons 20uL Filter Tips\nHard-Shell 384-Well PCR Plates, thin wall, skirted, clear/white #HSP3805\nNEST 96 Deepwell Plate 2mL",
